      "t": "Cheering from the aisle, Paquita promises Mariona roles in Spain's biggest television series and marches proudly out of the theatre with Magüi. As the upbeat closing montage plays, Paquita welcomes Mariona through the door of PS Management. Listen to the finale first.",
